              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "Marking"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "kg PO q24h; side effects include sedation,",
              "pdf_page": 953,
              "printed_page": 871,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "Marking"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "anorexia, irritability, urine retention, constipation.",
              "pdf_page": 953,
              "printed_page": 871,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "Marking"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Tricyclic antidepressants (TCAs)—clomi-",
